  dialogueLines:
  - Hey, please help! I've lost my phone!
  - I was taking a walk at the light house and dropped it off the side!
  - When i went down there to look, i couldn't find it anywhere! It must have buried
    in the sand.
  - Please bring it to me if you find it!
  searchingDialogueLines:
  - 'Any luck finding my phone? '
  turnInDialogueLines:
  - Great! You found my phone! I can finally finish that text.
  - Here, have this star. Thanks again for your help.
  completedDialogueLines:
  - She hasn't still texted back...
